---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">SEO & Digital Marketing, tracked in public</p>
  <h1>Rankings don't move by accident.<br>Here's what actually moves them.</h1>
  <p class="hero-dek">
    I write about SEO and digital marketing that's been tested on real sites — not
    recycled advice. I also do this for a living: if you'd rather hand it off,
    <a href="/services/">see how we can work together</a>.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/blog/">Read the blog</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/services/">Work with me</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Latest notes</h2>
    <a class="see-all" href="/blog/">All posts →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
      <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</p>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band">
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2>Need this done for your site, not just written about?</h2>
    <p>I take on a small number of SEO and digital marketing clients at a time — audits, content strategy, and hands-on execution.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services/">See services & pricing</a>
  </div>
</section>
